      "sequence_position": 2,
      "problem": "$10$ is **not** divisible by $3$ or $4.$\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:10\\text{ is divisible by }3$\n\n- $Q:10\\text{ is divisible by }4$",
      "worked_solution": "The given sentence is the negation of the following sentence: \n\n$10$ is divisible by $3$ or $4$, \n\nwhich can be expressed symbolically as $P∨Q.$\n\nThe negation is represented by the symbol \"$¬$\". \n\nTherefore, the given sentence is expressed symbolically as $¬(P∨Q).$",
